        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam Style strictuml\nskinparam DefaultFontName Arial\nskinparam DefaultFontSize 12\n\ntitle StrayToStay Inquiry Workflow (Activity Diagram)\n\n|Adopter Lane|\nstart\n:Open Pet Page;\n:Click \&quot;Send an inquiry\&quot;;\n\nif (Is User Logged In?) then (no)\n    :Redirect to /login;\n    :Log In;\n    note right: Session sets user_id\nelse (yes)\nendif\n\n:Fill Inquiry Type &amp; Message;\n:Click Submit;\n\n|Server Lane|\n:Receive Request at InquiryServlet;\nnote right: Reads user_id from session\n\nif (Is input data valid?) then (no)\n\n    |Adopter Lane|\n    :Show Validation Errors;\n    end\nelse (yes)\nendif\n\n|Server Lane|\n:Check uq_inquiry_per_user_pet;\nif (Already has an inquiry for this pet?) then (yes)\n\n    |Adopter Lane|\n    :Show Duplicate Message;\n    end\nelse (no)\nendif\n\n|Server Lane|\n:Save to Database with status &#39;NEW&#39;;\n:Email Shelter Staff;\n\n|Adopter Lane|\n:Show \&quot;Inquiry Sent\&quot; confirmation message;\n\n|Shelter Staff Lane|\n:Open Dashboard;\n:Open Inquiry Card;\nnote right: Database entry updates to &#39;READ&#39;\n\n:Type Response &amp; Click Reply;\nnote right: Database entry updates to &#39;REPLIED&#39;\n\n:Complete Conversation / Close Card;\nnote right: Database entry updates to &#39;CLOSED&#39;\n\nend\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="-PcLhjDS8DEEGomQbI6v-231">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
